OL,3,GNEWSATourist jailed for damaging       
OL,4,ABelfast's Big Fish                     
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for five months  
OL,7,Fafter causing an estimated #10,000     
OL,8,Fworth of damage to Belfast's Big Fish  
OL,9,Fsculpture.                             
OL,11,FPeter Smith, 44, of no fixed abode,    
OL,12,Fadmitted criminal damage and possessing
OL,13,Fitems with intent to damage property.  
OL,15,FHe is believed to have used a hatchet, 
OL,16,Fa hammer and a sledgehammer to smash   
OL,17,Fceramic tiles around the sculpture's   
OL,18,Fleft eye.                              
