OL,4,ABelfast's Big Fish                     
OL,6,FDistrict Judge Francis Rafferty told   
OL,7,FBelfast Magistrates' Court: "I regard  
OL,8,Fit as a targeted attack, but it remains
OL,9,Funexplained."                          
